<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49089" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρεπ-τήριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>feeding, nourishing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαστός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					545
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλόκαμος Ἰνάχῳ θ</span>. hair
				<i>dedicated as a thank-offering</i> to Inachus, ib. <i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρεπτήριον, τό</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρεπτάριον</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				5.1708.248
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρεπτήρια, τά</span>, <i>reward for rearing</i>, made to nurses by
			parents, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				168
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				223
			</span></i>; also, <i>return made by children for their rearing</i> (
				Att.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφεῖα</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				188
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>nourishment</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ . . νηδύος
			θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1263
			</span></i>.</div>
